            "block_content": "E. The Employer will provide bulletin boards in every facility. Facility shall be defined as a building with a separate Employee entrance. The employer will provide one bulletin board in the Stonestown facility to be located in the employee entrance area for posting of notices and jobs. The Union agrees it will not",
